From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:02:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vm: stack-allocate up to 4 native call arguments and skip
 no-op realm swap

Every built-in and host-proxy call previously called Vec::split_off to
heap-allocate an argument Vec even for 0-4 arguments, and native_function_call
cloned and swapped the active Realm even when the function had no custom realm.
Use a 4-element inline CallArgs buffer and skip swap_realm when realm is None.
---
 src/builtins/proxy/mod.rs  |  2 +-
 src/native_function/mod.rs | 34 ++++++++++++-----------
 src/vm/mod.rs              | 55 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 74 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

